{"type": "thinking", "text": "Date gaps: compute 1981-02-14 18:32:00 to 2026-05-03 14:49:09. Let's verify.\n\nFrom 1981-02-14 to 2026-02-14 = 45 years. Then 2026-02-14 to 2026-05-03: Feb 14→Mar 14 = 1 month (28 days), Mar 14→Apr 14 = 1 month, Apr 14→May 3 = 19 days. So 45y 2mo 19d? Hmm, let's be careful. The app says 45y 2mo 18d. Depends on convention. Alternatively Feb 14 + 2 months = Apr 14, then Apr 14 → May 3 = 19 days. Hmm.\n\nLet's compute time: from 18:32:00 to 14:49:09 next day would be 20:17:09 if day borrow. Actually app says 20h 17min 9s. If days = 18, then time difference 18:32:00 → 14:49:09 = 20:17:09 which implies a borrow of one day: 18 days + (20:17:09)? Wait if we take 18 days and 20:17:09, then from Feb14 18:32 to ... hmm.\n\nLet me compute days between. Using month convention: 45 years 2 months 18 days 20:17:09. Total duration should be exact.\n\nLet me compute total seconds. Easier: compute date difference.\n\n1981-02-14 18:32:00 to 2026-05-03 14:49:09.\n\nDays: from 1981-02-14 to 2026-02-14 = 45 years, with leap days: years 1984,88,92,96,2000,04,08,12,16,20,24 = 11 leap days. 45*365+11 = 16425+11 = 16436 days. Wait 2026-02-14 is before Feb 29 2028, so leap years in [1981,2026): 1984..2024 = 11. Yes 16436 days.\n\n2026-02-14 to 2026-05-03: Feb has 28 days in 2026. Feb 14→Feb 28 = 14 days, +Mar 31 = 45, +Apr 30 = 75, +3 = 78 days. So total days = 16436+78 = 16514 days.\n\nTime component: 18:32:00 to 14:49:09 = (14:49:09 + 24h) - 18:32:00 = 20:17:09 on the previous day, so total = 16513 days + 20:17:09.\n\nNow app: 45y 2mo 18d 20h 17min 9s. Need to verify this equals 16513 days + 20:17:09. 45 years = 16436 days as computed (to Feb 14 2026). +2 months → Apr 14 2026 = 59 days (Feb14→Mar14 28, Mar14→Apr14 31) = 59. Then 18 days → May 2. Hmm Apr 14 + 18 = May 2. But we need May 3 minus 1 day borrow = May 2. Right: total is 16513 days = 45y + 2mo + 18d, then time 20:17:09 which borrows one day? Let me check: 16436+59+18 = 16513 days. Yes! And then time 20:17:09 but that means date reached 2026-05-02 18:32 + 20:17:09 = 2026-05-03 14:49:09. Wait, 16513 days after 1981-02-14 18:32 = 2026-05-02 18:32. Plus 20:17:09 = 2026-05-03 14:49:09. Correct. So the app is right.\n\nSecond: 2020-03-10 22:15:00 to 2024-08-25 09:40:30 = 4y 5mo 14d 11h25min30s.\nDays from 2020-03-10 to 2024-03-10 = 4 years incl leap 2024 Feb 29 = 1461 days. +5 months: Mar10→Apr10 31, Apr10→May10 30, May10→Jun10 31, Jun10→Jul10 30, Jul10→Aug10 31 = 153 days. Total to Aug 10 2024. +14 days = Aug 24. Then time 11:25:30 → Aug 25 09:40:30. Wait Aug 24 22:15 + 11:25:30 = Aug 25 09:40:30. Yes correct. 4y5mo14d 11h25m30s. Correct.\n\nThird: date(2024,1,1) to date(2024,1,8) = 1 wk. Correct.\n\nNow Time differences."}
