rsist (it's DB). Let's test later.\n\nPotential bug: The lock icon/indicator. Locked file shows \"Locked\" label. Fine.\n\nPotential bug: Locked file's results might not be computed? They are.\n\nPotential bug: When opening a locked file, the \"More options\" still allows \"Unlock\" etc. Fine.\n\nPotential bug: pinned file in the PINNED section might not be clickable if locked? It is.\n\nPotential bug: The file \"Expenses\" is pinned, but when searching, does it show pinned at top? Hmm.\n\nPotential bug: You can still edit a locked file via the temporary scratchpad? no.\n\nPotential bug: Lock is enforced visually but typing via hardware keyboard might still change content? We pressed DEL and no change. Let's try type_text on locked file. Actually the file is read-only and keyboard didn't open. Good.\n\nPotential bug: Locking a file while its editor is open elsewhere? no.\n\nPotential bug: \"Pin\" menu item on a locked file works, and \"Unpin\" works. fine.\n\nLet's test lock persistence after backgrounding. Press HOME, then open_app.\n\nActually let's first finish with Expenses restored and go home, then HOME + open_app."}
